@local/dsh-archived-session-cleaner README · Notes：- Archived sessions only. A session that is running, or still loaded in the current app run, is skipped — restart the app, then delete again
- Deletion is permanent
- Runs entirely on this machine: no network requests, no telemetry

@local/dsh-archived-session-cleaner README · 注意：- 只删已归档的会话；正在运行、或还留在当前 App 内存里的会话会被跳过，重启 App 后再删
- 删除不可恢复
- 全程在本机执行，不联网、没有遥测
